    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d622-a10">

                <pb facs="0737" n="651" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg651"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Clayton to Mr. Carothers.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-26"><hi rendition="#italic">February 26,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is status of Brakeman McVea’s case referred to in your letter May 16 last
                    regarding which I want information.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
